THIRD PARTY MATERIAL

This work references intellectual property of third parties for educational
and practitioner-reference purposes. Such references do not constitute
endorsement or affiliation. In particular:

- "Forge Works Blueprint" references summarise concepts publicly published
  by Dr David Provan and Forge Works consultancy. Forge Works retains all
  rights to its proprietary frameworks and materials. See
  https://forgeworks.com for authoritative content.

- Named safety science thinkers (Reason, Dekker, Hollnagel, Conklin,
  Edmondson, Provan, Rasmussen, Hopkins, Weick) retain copyright in their
  original published works. This skill summarises and applies their concepts
  for practitioner use; it does not reproduce substantial portions of their
  copyrighted material.

- Australian and New Zealand regulatory content draws on government
  publications (Safe Work Australia, state and territory regulators,
  WorkSafe NZ). Such content is generally in the public domain or available
  under government open licences; this skill is not endorsed by or
  affiliated with any regulator.

